    "sets": {
      "title": "Sets",
      "intro": "The same charms, different ways to wear. Start with the pieces in each set, then explore how they can be reused.",
      "availability": "These sets are being prepared. This page presents their planned contents and styling ideas.",
      "piece_note": "Pieces are counted individually. Two earrings make one pair; the internal parts of an assembled piece do not add to the set count.",
      "gift_title": "Sets to give",
      "gift_text": "Choose by how they like to wear jewellery: studs, hoops, a necklace or a ring. The contents stay the same across the suggested looks.",
      "s01_name": "Stud Earring Styling Set",
      "s01_contents_html": "<ul class=\"suiji-info__bom\"><li><strong>2</strong><span>Stud Earring Bases</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Metal Earring Backs</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Pearl Earring Backs</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Gemstone Charms</span></li></ul>",
      "s01_modes_html": "<ol class=\"suiji-info__modes\"><li><h4>Look A · Metal backs</h4><p>Fit one charm to each stud base and secure each with a metal earring back. Keep the two pearl backs aside.</p></li><li><h4>Look B · Pearl backs</h4><p>Keep the two front charms and replace the metal backs with the pearl backs. Use one back on each stud.</p></li><li><h4>Look C · Left and right</h4><p>Swap the two charms between ears. Two different selected stone colours can form an asymmetric pair; no additional charms are included.</p></li></ol>",
      "s01_limit": "Wear one pair of studs at a time. The metal and pearl backs are alternatives.",
      "s02_name": "Choker & Charm Set",
      "s02_contents_html": "<ul class=\"suiji-info__bom\"><li><strong>1</strong><span>Choker</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>Gemstone Charm</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>Pendant Base</span></li></ul>",
      "s02_modes_html": "<ol class=\"suiji-info__modes\"><li><h4>Look A · Pendant composition</h4><p>Fit the charm to the pendant base, then attach the base to the choker using the connection designed for this model.</p></li><li><h4>Look B · Choker on its own</h4><p>Remove the assembled pendant and wear the choker on its own, provided this design closes securely without the pendant.</p></li></ol>",
      "s02_limit": "One charm is included. This set does not include stud or ring bases.",
      "s03_name": "Ring & Two Charms Set",
      "s03_contents_html": "<ul class=\"suiji-info__bom\"><li><strong>1</strong><span>Ring Base</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Gemstone Charms</span></li></ul>",
      "s03_modes_html": "<ol class=\"suiji-info__modes\"><li><h4>Look A · First charm</h4><p>Wear the ring base with the first charm. Keep the second charm aside.</p></li><li><h4>Look B · Second charm</h4><p>Remove the first charm and fit the second to the same ring base. The ring and its size stay the same.</p></li></ol>",
      "s03_limit": "One ring base takes one charm at a time. This is not a two-ring set.",
      "s04_name": "Hoop Earring & Necklace Styling Set",
      "s04_contents_html": "<ul class=\"suiji-info__bom\"><li><strong>2</strong><span>Hoop Earrings</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Pendant Bases</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Gemstone Charms</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>Necklace</span></li></ul>",
      "s04_modes_html": "<ol class=\"suiji-info__modes\"><li><h4>Look A · Pair of pendant earrings</h4><p>Fit one charm to each pendant base and attach one assembled pendant to each hoop. Both charms are used for the earrings.</p></li><li><h4>Look B · Pendant necklace</h4><p>Move one assembled pendant from a hoop to the necklace. Keep the other aside, or use it only in a verified single-ear styling.</p></li><li><h4>Look C · Swap the pendant</h4><p>Swap the assembled pendant on the necklace for the other one to create a second necklace look using the same chain.</p></li></ol>",
      "s04_limit": "A fully charmed pair of earrings and a charmed necklace cannot be worn together with this set: that would require three charms.",
      "s05_name": "Stud Earring & Ring Styling Set",
      "s05_contents_html": "<ul class=\"suiji-info__bom\"><li><strong>2</strong><span>Stud Earring Bases</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Metal Earring Backs</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Pearl Earring Backs</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Gemstone Charms</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>Ring Base</span></li></ul>",
      "s05_modes_html": "<ol class=\"suiji-info__modes\"><li><h4>Look A · Pair of studs</h4><p>Use both charms on the pair of studs, with either the metal backs or the pearl backs. Keep the ring base aside.</p></li><li><h4>Look B · First ring look</h4><p>Move one charm from a stud to the ring base. Keep the other aside, or use it only in a verified single-ear styling.</p></li><li><h4>Look C · Second ring look</h4><p>Change the ring to the second charm. To return to the pair of charmed studs, move both charms back to the studs.</p></li></ol>",
      "s05_limit": "A fully charmed pair of studs plus a charmed ring would require three charms. This set contains two.",
      "s06_name": "Hoop Earring, Necklace & Ring Styling Set",
      "s06_contents_html": "<ul class=\"suiji-info__bom\"><li><strong>2</strong><span>Hoop Earrings</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Pendant Bases</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Gemstone Charms</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>Necklace</span></li><li><strong>1</strong><span>Ring Base</span></li></ul>",
      "s06_modes_html": "<ol class=\"suiji-info__modes\"><li><h4>Look A · Pair of pendant earrings</h4><p>Use both pendant bases and both charms with the pair of hoops. Keep the necklace and ring base aside.</p></li><li><h4>Look B · Necklace and ring</h4><p>Use one charm on a pendant base for the necklace. Remove the other charm from its pendant base and fit it to the ring base. Each charm occupies one styling position.</p></li><li><h4>Look C · Swap the charms</h4><p>Swap the two charms between the necklace pendant base and the ring base, reusing the same necklace and ring.</p></li></ol>",
      "s06_limit": "The four possible charm positions share two charms. This set does not fully decorate both ears, the necklace and the ring simultaneously. The two pendant bases are also reused."
    },
